{"id":"67a60f891de62bc0","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-adequate-set.md","title":"Adequate finite sets of modal formulas","display":"df-modal-adequate-set — Adequate finite sets of modal formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","aliases":["72-df-modal-adequate-set"],"display":"df-modal-adequate-set — Adequate finite sets of modal formulas","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, Definition 2.3 and the following sentence, printed p. 479, PDF p. 491","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"source definition checked; local recursive implementation and finite closure checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-adequate-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-adequate-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-adequate-set — Adequate finite sets of modal formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, Definition 2.3 and the following sentence, printed p. 479, PDF p. 491"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source definition checked; local recursive implementation and finite closure checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a> 的自由语法树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_m\\)</span> 是下式定义的子公式函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m\">\\(c_m\\)</span> 是对语法否定作一次增删的函数。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_m B=B\\to_m\\bot_m\">\\(\\neg_m B=B\\to_m\\bot_m\\)</span> 是宏，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\\to_m\\bot_m\">\\(A=B\\to_m\\bot_m\\)</span> 在此表示语法树相等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\\)</span> 与指定的有限闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\">\\(\\Phi_A\\)</span> 在下式引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_i\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(\\bot_m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot_m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A\\to_m B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\to_m B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(B),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(\\Box_m A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m A\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_i\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(\\bot_m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\bot_m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A\\to_m B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\to_m B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(B),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(\\Box_m A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m A\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\quad\nc_m(A)=C\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n(A=C\\to_m\\bot_m)\\ \\lor\\\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(A=B\\to_m\\bot_m)\\ \\land\\ C=A\\to_m\\bot_m\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\quad\nc_m(A)=C\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n(A=C\\to_m\\bot_m)\\ \\lor\\\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(A=B\\to_m\\bot_m)\\ \\land\\ C=A\\to_m\\bot_m\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\\ \\land\\\n\\forall B\\in\\Phi\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sub}_m(B)\\subseteq\\Phi\\ \\land\\ c_m(B)\\in\\Phi\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\\ \\land\\\n\\forall B\\in\\Phi\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sub}_m(B)\\subseteq\\Phi\\ \\land\\ c_m(B)\\in\\Phi\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\}\\cup\n\\{c_m(B):B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\}\\cup\n\\{c_m(B):B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim A\">\\(\\sim A\\)</span> 表示删去或添上最外层否定；这里用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m\">\\(c_m\\)</span> 避免与算术否定或满足关系混淆。在当前基础语言中，蕴涵到假即是语法否定，所有复合联结词均先按上游宏展开。定义图的第一种情形由自由构造子的单射性唯一确定 C；第二种情形返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to_m\\bot_m\">\\(A\\to_m\\bot_m\\)</span>。两种情形互斥且穷尽，故定义一个全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\mathcal F_m\">\\(c_m:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，没有自由的模式逆像变量。子公式函数按严格子树递归，输出有限。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\">\\(\\Phi_A\\)</span> 包含 A，有限，且为 adequate set：先取子公式集并显式加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_m\">\\(\\bot_m\\)</span>；原有子公式的子公式仍在这个集合中。新添的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_m B\">\\(\\neg_m B\\)</span> 只增加 B 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_m\">\\(\\bot_m\\)</span> 作为子公式，删去否定只返回原有子公式。对新添的否定再施 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m\">\\(c_m\\)</span> 返回 B，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(\\bot_m)\">\\(c_m(\\bot_m)\\)</span> 也被显式加入。因而无需迭代无穷多个双重否定。假不能只在最后单独加入，否则以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=p_i\">\\(A=p_i\\)</span> 为例会漏掉 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_m(\\bot_m)\">\\(c_m(\\bot_m)\\)</span>。遮去本节后，定义及两个分支仍由前两节完全确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的自由语法树 $\\mathcal F_m$。$A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m$，$i\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_m","display":false},{"tex":"c_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_m B=B\\to_m\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"A=B\\to_m\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(p_i)&\\coloneqq\\{p_i\\},&\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(\\bot_m)&\\coloneqq\\{\\bot_m\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A\\to_m B)&\\coloneqq\\{A\\to_m B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(B),&\n\\operatorname{Sub}_m(\\Box_m A)&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box_m A\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A,C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\quad\nc_m(A)=C\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n(A=C\\to_m\\bot_m)\\ \\lor\\\n\\bigl(\\neg\\exists B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\;(A=B\\to_m\\bot_m)\\ \\land\\ C=A\\to_m\\bot_m\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adeq}_m(\\Phi)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\\ \\land\\\n\\forall B\\in\\Phi\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sub}_m(B)\\subseteq\\Phi\\ \\land\\ c_m(B)\\in\\Phi\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\}\\cup\n\\{c_m(B):B\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_m(A)\\cup\\{\\bot_m\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sim A","display":false},{"tex":"c_m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to_m\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"c_m:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_m B","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_m","display":false},{"tex":"c_m","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(\\bot_m)","display":false},{"tex":"A=p_i","display":false},{"tex":"c_m(\\bot_m)","display":false}],"bytes":3109,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-adequate-set|df-modal-adequate-set — Adequate finite sets of modal formulas]]"},{"id":"a84520417d5eb9a3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-assumption-derivability]] 的 $\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathsf{GL}}$ 和 [[72-df-modal-adequate-set]] 的 $\\operatorname{Adeq}_m$。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-modal-adequate-set|df-modal-adequate-set — Adequate finite sets of modal formulas]]"},{"id":"f13b228413db1156","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-modal-adequate-set]]"}],"outgoing":["94fb82dfe6146007"]}